title: NPC1_Ending
---
<<SetCharacterPicture AVATAR_PNJ_GUY_HAPPY>>
Hubert: Arf. The manager of this floor seems to be absent. #line:0bd441a 
Hubert: I’m not sure if they’re on leave or just taking a break that feels like an eternity, but it looks like you’ll have to wait to meet them. #line:0a86e57 
Hubert: Lucky you—I’ve heard they’re pretty strict.. #line:0e14cf6 
Hubert: In the mean time, thanks for your job here. #line:036ed76 
Hubert: You are a really precious asset to this company. #line:04d9211 
Hubert: Here you go. A few meal tickets <sprite name=MT> for you... #line:071f372 
Hubert: See you later ! #line:07c0e07 
<i>\[This is the end of the playtest.\]</i> #line:0ad0f08 
<i>\[Thank you for playing =) \]</i> #line:0fe88aa 
===

title: NPC1_NewFrigo
---
<<SetCharacterPicture AVATAR_PNJ_GUY_HAPPY>>
Hubert: Oh sweet, the <wave>fridge</wave> is back! I can’t wait to watch other employees stick angry post-its on their food — it’s going to be my new little dramedy. #line:07ab75e 
-> Dee: My favourite office drama! #line:08b3184 
-> Dee: Are you the one stealing them? #line:015f683 
<<SetCharacterPicture AVATAR_PNJ_GUY_ANGRY>>
Hubert: You can’t prove anything girl, step back. #line:03045ff 
===
title: NPC1_Introduction
---
<<SetCharacterPicture AVATAR_PNJ_GUY_HAPPY>>
Hubert: Hey!  
Hubert: How are you?
-> Dee: I'm... well ? #line:07ab713 
-> Dee: Who are you again? #line:08167f5 
<<SetCharacterPicture AVATAR_PNJ_GUY_ANGRY>>
Hubert: Anyway! You should go ahead. #line:032d404 
<<ShowExitClue HubManager>>
===
title: NPC1_ShopFirstTime
---
<<SetCharacterPicture>>
The shopkeeper isn't very chatty, but...
... You should find some great items to help you out here! #line:0afe78e 
===

title: NPC1_Hello
---
<<SetCharacterPicture AVATAR_PNJ_GUY_HAPPY>>
=> Hubert: Hey there !
=> Hubert: Hi darling.
=> Hubert: Been a while !
<<jump NPC1_ContextualTalk>>
===

title: NPC1_Menu
---
-> Dee: Show item <<if CheckHasAnyStoryItem()>>
    Hubert: You got something you want to show me ? 
    <<jump NPC1_ShowItem>>
-> Dee : Talk
    <<jump NPC1_Talk>>
-> Dee : Bye
    Hubert: Nice day !
===

title: NPC1_ShowItem
---
-> Dee : Ball <<if CheckHasStoryItem("Ball")>>
    Hubert: Looks brand new. You bought that ?
-> Dee : Bubble <<if CheckHasStoryItem("Bubble")>>
    Hubert: Oh yeah I've seen it many times around here.
-> Dee : Pen <<if CheckHasStoryItem("Pen")>>
    Hubert: No way !!!
    Hubert: I've been looking for this pen for ages !!
    Hubert: Where did you find it ?
    Hubert: You know what- this is a stupid question forget it.
    Hubert: Thanks a lot for giving it back.
    Hubert: It's... It means a lot to me.
    Hubert: Thanks.
    <<GiveStoryItemToNPC Pen>>
    <<jump NPC1_Menu>>
-> Dee : Slime <<if CheckHasStoryItem("Slime")>>
    Hubert: Uhhhh. Looks sticky.
-> Dee : Strange Stuff <<if CheckHasStoryItem("Strange Stuff")>>
    Hubert: I feel like this shouldn't even be in the office to be honest.
-> Dee : Back
    Hubert: What's up girl ?
    <<jump NPC1_Menu>>
=> Hubert: Wanna show me something else ?
=> Hubert: Anything else ?
=> Hubert: Other stuff you want me to look at ?
<<jump NPC1_ShowItem>>
===

title: NPC1_Talk
when: GetRelationLevel("Hubert") == 0 || GetRelationLevel("Hubert") == 1
---
<<once>>
    Hubert: Been a while since we talked right ? 
    Hubert: I feel like you're ignoring me.
    Hubert: But that's just in my head right.
    <<AddRelationLevel Hubert>>
<<endonce>>
Hubert: You get what I mean ?
===
title: NPC1_Talk
when: GetRelationLevel("Hubert") == 2 || GetRelationLevel("Hubert") == 3
---
<<once>>
    Hubert: I feel like we're getting closer you and me. 
    Hubert: I wonder if you feel the same ?...
    Hubert: ...
    <<AddRelationLevel Hubert>>
<<endonce>>
Hubert: Yeah, you can also keep it a secret no problem.
===

title: NPC1_ContextualTalk
when: always 
---
<<jump NPC1_Menu>>>>
===

title: NPC1_ContextualTalk
when: GetNumberOfRun() > 0
when: once 
---
Hubert: Oh wow you've been out of the office ?!
Hubert: I hope it was okay and you didn't get lost. 
Hubert: It's big out there. Be careful girl.
<<jump NPC1_Menu>>>>
===